Source distribution, 2026-11-13:
The public formatter source download includes the retained and generated engine,
complete disposable worker, protocol, synthetic fixtures, browser client,
provenance, dependency lockfile, rebuild scripts and required notices. The source
link is available alongside the application's explicit formatter preview action.
The separately built formatter communicates with its host through a bounded
postMessage request/reply protocol. It performs no network requests. Private user
templates and native configurations are not part of the public distribution.
